{"by": {"dictionary": 29, "product": 10, "rule": 3}, "en": {"brand:ac5e0e1b100d0308": "Yamaha", "option_name:8d1a750c9351d1b8": "Set", "option_value:a839786802f114aa": "Driver 11.5L, #4 Wood, #7 Wood, #5 Hybrid, 7 Irons, Putter + Bag", "option_value:e17a604ac3d9ef71": "11.5L, #4 #7 Wood #5 Hybrid 7 Irons Putter, No Bag", "review:547f658b0fcf1061": "After waiting so long, I do like the design. But I understand iron covers were supposed to come with it, and they didn't. Please check on this.", "review:550b0fad8c788527": "Honestly the 2018 Yamaha Femina looks way better than the 2023 version. I was told the performance isn't that different, so I went with the design I liked. They also told me the half bag colors.", "review:560a5533bf3e1b00": "Awesome. My old clubs were heavy, so I was looking for lighter ones and picked this. I'm happy with the set makeup, the design and the service. I'll use them for a month and see.", "review:56a4286d772bb16d": "My skills aren't there yet, so I haven't used every club. But the value is great. I'm going to work on my game and take the full set out once the weather warms up.", "review:9b1f173b464c4647": "I waited a long time, but with clubs this hard to find these days, I'm just glad I got them. The iron covers are pink, which is a bit much. I bought the bag in white, so it's not bad.", "review:a6f9e57ba3cb5103": "Pleasantly surprised. The iron covers are shipping separately, they're light and nice. The bag is pretty too. Good overall. I'll wait for the iron covers to arrive.", "review:e07d4cd2ae9f660e": "I'm a beginner golfer at 1 month in, so I can't really speak to how it feels, but I've only used rental clubs, and compared to those this feels a bit lighter and nicer. I picked it because I totally fell for the design and colors. Bummer that there were no iron covers, and the glove they sent was way too small. I took it as a little cheer for hitting it farther, which was a thoughtful touch, though I'm not sure what it's meant for. Anyway, I'm happy with the product overall.", "review:e12a5779e0dffedf": "The packaging was neat and pretty. I'm not strong, so with heavy clubs my best distance was 120. I searched a lot, and since people say beginners should go for what looks good and what they like, I picked the sky blue Yamaha Femina. The driver is light, so it's easy to carry around. My distance definitely went up. I've heard from others that it's whippy, but I was looking for that feel on purpose, so if you want light clubs, this is perfect!", "spec_label:04c52e5b47f70047": "Putter Type", "spec_label:27a9b13cf3b83049": "Iron Composition", "spec_label:2e6adf4ec98d6823": "Type", "spec_label:3ecc0ce552283c4e": "Manufacturer", "spec_label:45ecef3c70c3d0be": "Model", "spec_label:559380a1cea8a17c": "Brand", "spec_label:5a12089f44ae3f65": "Iron Shaft Material", "spec_label:765723acfadff305": "Country of Origin", "spec_label:84af996296131844": "Model Year", "spec_label:8c8cb3b96f7fe3e9": "Driver Loft", "spec_label:b6eec4943f7543e8": "Gender", "spec_label:cf77915a2f3ab5d8": "Number of Irons", "spec_label:e4aabb2e41b870bd": "Golf Bag Included", "spec_label:ed8bec519f97c9d9": "Set Composition", "spec_label:edb42073f8735b63": "Handedness", "spec_value:0c5a3886c288bcd6": "7", "spec_value:14dc0bae76e6f933": "Right-Handed", "spec_value:432a74bb0c5028af": "#6, #7, #8, #9, Pitching Wedge (PW), Approach Wedge (AW), Sand Wedge (SW)", "spec_value:678b2859627caaa3": "Driver, 7-Piece Iron Set, 2 Fairway Woods, Hybrid, Putter, Wedge", "spec_value:6f196050e8cda9f8": "Femina Complete Set 12 Pieces 2018 Women's", "spec_value:92917baf006633bb": "Mallet", "spec_value:96f0fed466f17e8e": "Not Included", "spec_value:a633376d7e319617": "Complete Set", "spec_value:ac5e0e1b100d0308": "Yamaha", "spec_value:bed47e98ee4bbea0": "2023", "spec_value:ef00cceb8d6a2241": "Graphite/Carbon", "spec_value:efe3136bd7890788": "11.5°", "spec_value:f6e28ba7ee26a02e": "China", "spec_value:ff90d7cd3c519c1f": "Women's", "title:3e54405bee1a9986": "Yamaha Femina Women's Complete Golf Set 2023, Driver 11.5L, #4 Wood, 7 Irons, 12 Pieces"}, "format": "translated/1", "key": "fairwardgolf:naver:100416178:5917858699", "missing": [], "model_calls": 0, "problems": [], "provider": null, "status": "translated"}
